Certainly! Below are two short scripts demonstrating how to implement a button with an icon using the Font Awesome library in a Vue.js application. The first script uses Font Awesome 4 syntax, and the second uses Font Awesome 5 syntax.

### Script 1: Using Font Awesome 4 Syntax

First, ensure you have included Font Awesome 4 in your project, typically by adding the following line to your HTML file:
```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
```

Now, here is the Vue.js component script:

